<title>SINGAPORE: Pacific Century in S$112.2 mln deal.</title>
<headline>Pacific Century in S$112.2 mln deal.</headline>
<dateline>SINGAPORE 1996-12-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Pacific Century Regional Developments Ltd said on Thursday its subsidiary Riyan Pte Ltd had agreed to buy a Singapore property for Singapore $112.2 million.  </p>
<p>The company said in a statement the 56,483 square feet site will be developed into a 120-unit condominium project.</p>
<p>The purchase of the property is proposed to be financed by a combination of external bank borrowings and internal resources.</p>
<p>-- Singapore newsroom (65 8703080)</p>
